        "research": {
            "topic": "Snorkel AI: from agent traces to replayable agent simulations",
            "summary": "Snorkel AI argues production traces can't be replayed cleanly because databases, tool versions and environments drift, so it converts them into offline, deterministic simulation environments that mirror a company's own tools, APIs and policies. The company backs this with its own benchmark suite (Terminal-Bench, Snorkel Agentic Coding, SnorkelFinance, UNDERWRITE) and a $3M open-benchmarks grant program.",
